  "_FfUWEaN1EfCxxJ9emeyVvA": "Scope and Usage|The MarketClaimCreation message is sent by an account servicer to an account holder to advise the creation of a market claim transaction on a securities account, that has been automatically generated (for example by a CSD) on a mandatory distribution type of corporate action event. |This message definition is intended for use with the Business Application Header (BAH).",
