  "_ID_0MZaOEfC2_67yGLymgA": "Scope|An account servicer sends a SecuritiesSettlementTransactionModificationRequestStatusAdvice to an account owner to advise the status of a SecuritiesSettlementModificationRequest message previously sent by the account owner.|The account servicer may be:|- a central securities depository or another settlement market infrastructure managing securities settlement transactions on behalf of their participants|- an custodian acting as an accounting and/or settlement agent.||Usage|The message may also be used to:|- re-send a message sent by the account owner to the account servicer,|- provide a third party with a copy of a message being sent by the account owner for information,|- re-send to a third party a copy of a message being sent by the account owner for information|using the relevant elements in the Business Application Header.",
