  "_T5oiANp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_1497161223": "Time span defined by a start date and time, and an end date and time.",
  "_T5pTMaEPEe-MRKYsaX6JDg": "Acknowledgement of the exception advice.",
  "_T6OX59p-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_1215657154": "Choice between a date or a date and time format.",
  "_T6hS0tp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_177856099": "Parameters of a physical delivery.",
  "_T8MgUWKOEe6iKbrXdnOlfA": "Specifies security date details.",
  "_T9Cs1ZliEeeE1Ya-LgRsuQ": "Liquidity set aside by the account owner for specific purposes.",
  "_T9pfVdp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_-1701633190": "Specifies whether or not the debit authorisation is granted.",
  "_TBij0TqrEeWyoP0PbocV1Q": "Choice of format for the acknowledgement reason.",
  "_TCoJUe6SEemVDc1WJaqofw": "Information about actions that may be taken on an account.",
  "_TCzAqtp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_1989939445": "Choice of identifiers for a clearing system member, as assigned by the clearing system. In some clearing systems, the accounts of the clearing system members are also assigned an identifier.",
  "_TDntl-FWEeWIA4E9cYSxxQ": "Choice of format for the processing status.",
  "_TF7NItp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_365018897": "Set of elements that further identifies the type of local instruments being requested by the initiating party.",
  "_TFLmQNp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_-1953949955": "Information that locates and identifies a specific branch of a financial institution.",
  "_TF_lcAEcEeCQm6a_G2yO_w_1888102349": "Data related to a component of the POI performing the transaction.",
  "_TFsqdwEcEeCQm6a_G2yO_w_-629860519": "Identification of the transaction in an unambiguous way.",
  "_TGJWZgEcEeCQm6a_G2yO_w_-976075927": "The capabilities of the display components performing the transaction.",
