  "f36c5c5e-539b-48a7-974d-3cfeeacd209e": "The CreditorPaymentActivationRequestStatusReport message is sent by a party to the next party in the creditor payment activation request chain. It is used to inform the latter about the positive or negative status of a creditor payment activation request (either single or file).",
