  "4bbccf60-3e00-43bd-b80d-cbeaa551d017": "Party that manages the account on behalf of the account owner, that is manages the registration and booking of entries on the account, calculates balances on the account and provides information about the account.",
  "4c0823c1-e6c9-4976-bee6-76d903c80b9a": "Reuters Identification Code (RIC). A numbering system used within the Reuters system to identify instruments worldwide. The RIC contains an X-character market specific code (can be the CUSIP or EPIC codes) followed by a full stop, then the two-digit ISO country code, for example, IBM in UK is IBM.UK.",
