  "4ce599f8-32f1-4f5d-9fd3-b8e4a4dec59f": "Specifies the features that may apply to a corporate action option.",
  "4cf00750-c433-40f6-9d8f-929fd976e745": "Provides information on the charges related to the processing of the rejection of the instruction.||Usage: This is passed on for information purposes only. Settlement of the charges will be done separately.",
  "4d1a33cb-3706-4ae5-a071-67188c42aa2e": "Specifies whether the financial instrument calculates the taxable income per dividend/taxable income per share.",
  "4d234a65-dbab-4e6c-9d7b-4c06103c155b": "Provides further information in order to identify a previous payment notification.",
  "4d3c7fb5-37e9-42e6-8c69-bf014947bd27": "Information needed to process a currency exchange or conversion.|How the exchange rate is expressed determines which currency is the Unit Currency and Quoted Currency. If the amounts concerned are EUR 1000 and USD 1300, the exchange rate may be expressed as per either of the following examples:|EXAMPLE 1 |UnitCurrency EUR|QuotedCurrency USD|ExchangeRate 1.300|EXAMPLE 2|UnitCurrency USD|QuotedCurrency EUR|ExchangeRate 0.769.",
