  "4db29bc6-f9e1-4c06-a1fe-885ec8150079": "Unambiguous identification of the securities transaction as known by the securities account owner (or the instructing party managing the account).",
  "4dca764a-5743-4d20-b854-242e4976102d": "Unique and unambiguous identifier for a group of individual transfers as assigned by the instructing party. This identifier links the individual transfers together.",
