  "4eb54b10-8e95-4903-9bfb-eb60b355dc3c": "Specifies the rules that are applicable to the drawdown. For example, in the UK market, the pre-A-day rule that was introduced on 6 April 2006.)",
  "4eb6c6c4-bd92-4294-9c31-b450c566de27": "Underlying reason for the payment transaction.|Usage: Purpose is used by the end-customers, that is initiating party, (ultimate) debtor, (ultimate) creditor to provide information concerning the nature of the payment. Purpose is a content element, which is not used for processing by any of the agents involved in the payment chain.",
  "4eb7a5d7-dc9c-4f63-b028-b38937220497": "Deal amount.",
  "4f02462b-d70a-4718-a581-3931d0eed4aa": "Date to be used as the trade date when securities are settled through an International Central Securities Depository (ICSD) or Central Securities Depository (CSD).",
  "4f0b0c43-8dbb-4180-b996-469f0af2e03a": "Specifies the type of the return transaction.",
  "4f1b0d0e-29b0-4cf1-a411-d66cf99d9204": "Unambiguous identification of the account of the debtor to which a debit entry will be made as a result of the transaction.",
