  "b68e500c-7a18-49f1-8a37-3b9f9c8283d9": "Fee related to the transfer of the financial instrument.",
  "b6bf18ae-de7e-412a-a9dd-a46b7f3c6bde": "Amount of money asked or paid as compensation for the processing of the instruction.",
  "b6faab0b-3f90-43ff-83cc-e6abb35b642e": "Indicates whether the assets are held in an individual’s own name.",
  "b740d0a9-1d0e-496c-85d2-256ff6ec089d": "Place where the securities are safe-kept, physically or notionally. This place can be, for example, a local custodian, a Central Securities Depository (CSD) or an International Central Securities Depository (ICSD).",
