  "b7bc77be-6fcf-4e75-b3d0-a81f5572112b": "Payment process for the transfer of cash from the debtor to the creditor.",
  "b7bc8a68-9213-4294-86ab-429e499ac74f": "Agent between the debtor's agent and the creditor's agent.||Usage: If more than one intermediary agent is present, then IntermediaryAgent1 identifies the agent between the DebtorAgent and the IntermediaryAgent2.",
  "b7d1f5ce-e0e8-4b85-b753-ea0a7d809a06": "Indicates whether the financial instrument is to be physically delivered.",
  "b7d5b20d-300c-4359-b062-4e429f659c43": "Information concerning the original transactions, to which the cancellation request message refers.",
  "b7ff82ab-ae85-4746-b605-2aff408b0e4a": "Status of affirmation of a trade.",
