  "b92269e0-c05a-42a9-b0dd-312a411ac449": "Unique identification, as assigned by an instructing party for an instructed party, to unambiguously identify the instruction.||Usage: The instruction identification is a point to point reference that can be used between the instructing party and the instructed party to refer to the individual instruction. It can be included in several messages related to the instruction.",
  "b94ec393-9983-4676-9c61-dacf357da7d7": "Digital account where digital assets or digital tokens can be stored and where an entry is made.",
  "b95196d4-1a27-43db-83ac-6832095caa5b": "Identification of a counterparty transaction assigned by a market infrastructure other than a central securities depository, for example, Target2-Securities.",
  "b95bfa26-b565-459e-b720-a1224291db62": "Specifies the status of a transaction, as published in an external payment transaction status code list.",
  "b96a9ac3-e7bb-4c61-8693-e6c314cfc364": "Provides detailed information on the original amount.||Usage: This component (on transaction level) should be used in case booking is for a single transaction and the original amount is different from the entry amount. It can also be used in case individual original amounts are provided in case of a batch or aggregate booking.",
  "b9a360c7-fd09-4a12-8977-aaf366c4cb65": "Wertpapier Kenn-nummer. A number issued in Germany by the Wertpapier Mitteilungen. The Wertpapier Kenn-nummer, sometimes called WPK, contains 6-digits, but no check digit. There are different ranges of numbers representing different classes of securities.",
  "b9a39e0a-e1e5-41f4-8a02-c62bfb52439b": "Date or tax quarter used for the calculation of tax on the asset.",
  "b9b0e0ad-2b61-4ac3-afb6-61bf36464ac2": "Committee on Uniform Securities and Identification Procedures (CUSIP). The standards body that created and maintains the securities classification system in the US. The CUSIP is composed of a 9-character number that uniquely identifies a particular security. Non-US securities have a similar number called the CINS number.",
  "b9d9e4e3-c695-4bcd-a6a6-68a30253f8a8": "Total of all individual amounts included in the original payment information group, irrespective of currencies.",
  "ba68838f-7e81-4095-a772-141340cb0cb2": "Value of the security, as booked in the account. Book value is often different from the current market value of the security.",
  "bae84e0f-fb53-4eb8-9f50-1ebca70746d3": "Agent between the debtor's agent and the creditor's agent.||Usage: If IntermediaryAgent3 is present, then it identifies the agent between the IntermediaryAgent 2 and the CreditorAgent.",
