  "bde1642b-02c9-4837-94cb-beffad14fad2": "Specifies the date/time on which the trade was executed.",
  "bde55482-419a-46f1-941f-6f170507c62a": "Beneficial owner or its designated agent certifies that it complies with any holding or investment restrictions or requirements of the fund.",
  "be09f0b2-bce8-43fb-af1d-f825e1e88ef6": "Identification of the agent or party who the requestor of the investigation expects the responder to contact in relation to the investigation request.",
  "be0b4e8c-6ad8-4030-a2e5-4970cb59a852": "Information related to the financial instrument transferred.",
