  "13c9a2e1-3d3c-48d9-8945-8a30aba9c96c": "Event is the distribution of profits resulting from the sale of securities. Shareholders of mutual funds, unit trusts, or SICAVs are recipients of capital gains distributions and are often reinvested in additional shares of the fund.",
