  "_8JdAAaMgEeCJ6YNENx4h-w_-739454268": "Restriction is the creation of a reservation of a cash balance or a securities position for a specific purpose.",
  "_8JdAAqMgEeCJ6YNENx4h-w_-1357372058": "Restriction is the blocking of a party, securities account, security or cash account from settlement, blocking of securities position or cash balance for a specific purpose.",
