  "_8N7QWKMgEeCJ6YNENx4h-w_1890972049": "Used to query a specific liquidity transfer standing order based on a set of search criteria.",
  "_8NQ2MYqfEeS4a4abTJTSSw": "Cassette for reject.",
  "_8Nc8cT6JEemPvNTzinB5Vw": "Shares are held by the responding intermediary for its own account.|Usage: this type should only be used to report the intermediary’s own assets if and when the intermediary comingles them with the one of their clients.  Within jurisdictions where commingling is not allowed, this type should not be used.",
