  "_8O9yJ6MgEeCJ6YNENx4h-w_-635823395": "Balance representing the Forecast of the total of all cash-legs of transactions 'over the counter' (OTC), going through central counter party (CCP) functions.",
  "_8O9yJKMgEeCJ6YNENx4h-w_69291220": "Balance representing the cash equivalent of all settled securities transactions.",
