  "_D6zPc-33Eeqc-LCjwLsUVg": "Receive equities from the share premium reserve of the company and considered as a capital distribution rather than a disbursement of income with different tax implications (typically found in Australia).",
  "_D6zPce33Eeqc-LCjwLsUVg": "Vote expressed as abstain. In this case, the issuing company will add the number of shares to the quorum of the meeting.|If the voting right is not executed, it will not be added to the quorum. In this case, code NOAC should be used.",
