  "_D6zPge33Eeqc-LCjwLsUVg": "Vote to consent to change the terms of the securities agreement and to tender securities for cash.",
  "_D6zPh-33Eeqc-LCjwLsUVg": "Option that allows a holder to elect to retain their holding, for example, a putable bond.",
  "_D6zPhe33Eeqc-LCjwLsUVg": "Allow event or entitled security to expire.",
  "_D6zPi-33Eeqc-LCjwLsUVg": "Account owner is a non-qualified investor.",
  "_D6zPie33Eeqc-LCjwLsUVg": "Option for the account owner not to take part in the event. This would include opt-out for class actions and lodging of dissenters' rights.",
  "_D6zPj-33Eeqc-LCjwLsUVg": "Generic corporate action option to be used in case that no other specific code is appropriate.",
  "_D6zPje33Eeqc-LCjwLsUVg": "In a remarketing of variable notes, the margin that shareholders can propose in respect of the next interest period.",
  "_D6zPk-33Eeqc-LCjwLsUVg": "Account owner is a qualified investor.",
  "_D6zPke33Eeqc-LCjwLsUVg": "Subscribe to more equities than underlying securities position allows.",
  "_D6zPl-33Eeqc-LCjwLsUVg": "Sell the intermediate securities.",
  "_D6zPle33Eeqc-LCjwLsUVg": "Distribution of securities to holders.",
  "_D6zPme33Eeqc-LCjwLsUVg": "Proceeds not known during election period. The option can result in cash and/or securities.",
  "_D7GHASqAEeO3oOoGGWHH4A": "Other. See Narrative.",
  "_D7NbgRfwEeSBdtDwJiNe1g": "Other business day convention.",
  "_D8gGoQd2EeSPHJIdUs1USg": "Offshore.",
  "_D8nWMdEeEeiO-eodGv5iKQ": "Relates to a securities borrowing operation.",
