  "_DFXFkWSCEeKFfdK0gKYFLQ": "Buy securities up to next whole number.",
  "_DIQTAbMWEfCEXew4g5B5oA": "Tax rate is not consistent with the documentation in place.",
  "_DKR-cZUrEemC09f0MxYkRg": "Person known to be a close associate of the politically exposed person. A person known to be a close associate includes: |(a) a natural person who is known to have joint beneficial ownership of legal entities or legal arrangements, or any other close business relations, with the  politically exposed person,|(b) a natural person who has sole beneficial ownership of a legal entity or legal arrangement which is known to have been set up for the de facto benefit of a politically exposed person.",
  "_DNbt8bMWEfCEXew4g5B5oA": "Tax rate provided is incorrect. It falls outside the acceptable values for that investment country.",
  "_DOwSIWSCEeKFfdK0gKYFLQ": "Fractional part of cash. Take cash in lieu of fractions.",
  "_DQfy4dElEeiO-eodGv5iKQ": "Transaction is a change of an investment from one sub-fund to another sub-fund (redemption-leg).",
  "_DS_jYbMWEfCEXew4g5B5oA": "Instruction was received prior to entitlement date.",
  "_DT3eIWjCEeSP8Z8nx8HTuQ": "AES (Advanced Encryption Standard) CBC (Chaining Block Cypher) encryption with a 192 bits cryptographic key as defined by the Federal Information Processing Standards (FIPS 197 – November 6, 2001 - Advanced Encryption Standard).",
  "_DTG-8eXrEemEj48jhmlA0Q": "Rate relating to the underlying security for which other income is paid.",
  "_DWvk0dElEeiO-eodGv5iKQ": "Transaction is a change of an investment from one sub-fund to another sub-fund (subscription-leg).",
  "_DWxiUZUrEemC09f0MxYkRg": "Natural person who is or who has been entrusted with prominent public functions.",
  "_DXeHIdExEeiO-eodGv5iKQ": "Relates to a redemption of funds (funds industry only).",
  "_D_NecbM9EfCBi5X7hHnGKA": "Unrecognised or invalid financial instrument identification.",
  "_DaprYYobEeSirOZJBRz_nA": "Off-line PIN authentication (Personal Identification Number).",
  "_DdJI0RUNEeOIaq8KyCdIDQ": "Party that keeps accounting records of the available assets and liabilities of the fund. This party calculates deal prices, the Net Asset Value (NAV) of the fund, and may provide fund performance and tax data.",
  "_DdnxMZUrEemC09f0MxYkRg": "Family member of the politically exposed person. A family member includes: |(a) the spouse, or a person considered to be equivalent to a spouse, of the politically exposed person,|(b) the children and their spouses, or persons considered to be equivalent to a spouse, of the politically exposed person,|(c) the parents of the politically exposed person.",
  "_DeJbgWjCEeSP8Z8nx8HTuQ": "AES (Advanced Encryption Standard) CBC (Chaining Block Cypher) encryption with a 256 bits cryptographic key as defined by the Federal Information Processing Standards (FIPS 197 – November 6, 2001 - Advanced Encryption Standard).",
  "_DgP9EYobEeSirOZJBRz_nA": "On-line PIN authentication (Personal Identification Number).",
  "_DjSWMTDFEeunENYTWutRtQ": "Linked reference is unknown.",
  "_DoWIEWi8EeS87LmvcA55sg": "CMAC (Cipher based Message Authentication Code) defined by the National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST 800-38B - May 2005), using the block cipher Advanced Encryption Standard with a 192 bits cryptographic key, approved by the Federal Information Processing Standards (FIPS 197 - November 6, 2001 - Advanced Encryption Standard). The CMAC algorithm is computed on the SHA-384 digest of the message.",
  "_DoirIWSCEeKFfdK0gKYFLQ": "Take distribution of fractions in the form of securities.",
  "_DpW2gRfwEeSBdtDwJiNe1g": "Date will be the first following day that is a business day.",
  "_Dpx-MV25EeiFXdiLi_Nf4A": "Type of amount is a bonus, for example, a government bonus.",
  "_DsSH0REhEeKG5rB3aM9OkQ": "Specifies that the transaction/instruction is to be executed after the linked transaction/instruction.",
  "_DssjoeXrEemEj48jhmlA0Q": "Rate relating to the underlying security for which tax is charged.",
