  "_NMPEURUNEeOIaq8KyCdIDQ": "Agent that executes the payment. In the context of the investment fund industry, the paying agent is the local legal representative of the fund. It may pay out dividends, and collects money for the purchase of funds when a client deals directly with the fund and/or when a client deals with bearer shares. It pays out the redemption of the fund, may distribute information about the fund, and provides legal information about the fund.",
