  "_WWWiQZSbEfCQbtmJ-bHX4Q": "Issuer has the right to redeem all or part of the bonds before their maturity dates.",
  "_WY6HAZSbEfCQbtmJ-bHX4Q": "Bond sinking fund. Bond sinking fund is a financial mechanism used by bond issuers to set aside money for the purpose of repaying bondholders at maturity or through periodic redemptions.",
  "_WYejEb3SEeO2FLWuu_JIqg": "No holding for the specified underlying security.",
