  "_Yhalc9p-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_-1409524994": "457. Account is a non-qualified deferred compensation program that is available to state and local governments and not-for-profit employers (required for US).",
  "_YhalcNp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_-1409525166": "401k. Account is an optional retirement plan supported by many companies, in which income is invested before it is taxed (required for US).",
