  "_l1o1oRrkEeyhRdHRjakS2w": "Vote participation is through electronic means like dedicated standards messaging or web based voting applications.",
  "_l21ckTDqEey2N-DB7H7A5A": "Identifies when a publicly traded partnership identifies the amount realised on such portion of the distribution as an amount in excess of cumulative net income under IRS regulation 1.1446(f)-4(c)(2)(iii).",
  "_l4A10YSKEe-AUMVyVXihZg": "Offer made by the offeror for a portion of the outstanding shares not already owned by the offeror.",
  "_l6s70RrkEeyhRdHRjakS2w": "Vote participation is through physical attendance.",
  "_l8aI-6Q4EfC7Z_RW6qWkKA": "Exchange of holdings for other securities and/or cash. The exchange can be either mandatory or voluntary involving the exchange of outstanding securities for different securities and/or cash. For example \"exchange offer\", \"capital reorganisation\" or \"funds separation\".",
  "_l8aI-aQ4EfC7Z_RW6qWkKA": "Bonus or capitalisation issue. Security holders receive additional assets free of payment from the issuer, in proportion to their holding.",
  "_l8aI46Q4EfC7Z_RW6qWkKA": "Dividend payment where holders can keep cash or have the cash reinvested in the market by the issuer into additional shares in the issuing company. To be distinguished from DVOP as the company invests the dividend in the market rather than creating new share capital in exchange for the dividend.",
  "_l8aI4aQ4EfC7Z_RW6qWkKA": "Offer to existing holders by the issuing company to repurchase its own securities. The objective of the offer is to reduce the number of outstanding securities.",
  "_l8aI56Q4EfC7Z_RW6qWkKA": "Distribution of dividend option.",
  "_l8aI5aQ4EfC7Z_RW6qWkKA": "Distribution of cash to shareholders, in proportion to their equity holding. Ordinary dividends are recurring and regular. Shareholder must take cash and may be offered a choice of currency.",
  "_l8aI66Q4EfC7Z_RW6qWkKA": "Form of open or public offer where, due to a limited amount of securities available, priority is given to existing shareholders.",
  "_l8aI6aQ4EfC7Z_RW6qWkKA": "Call or exercise on nil paid securities or intermediate securities resulting from an intermediate securities distribution (RHDI). This code is used for the second event, when an intermediate securities' issue (rights/coupons) is composed of two events, the first event being the distribution of intermediate securities.",
  "_l8aI76Q4EfC7Z_RW6qWkKA": "Dividend paid to shareholders in the form of equities of the issuing corporation.",
  "_l8aI7aQ4EfC7Z_RW6qWkKA": "Dividend or interest paid in the form of scrip.",
  "_l8aI86Q4EfC7Z_RW6qWkKA": "Distribution of cash, assets or both. Debt may be paid in order of priority based on preferred claims to assets specified by the security.",
  "_l8aI8aQ4EfC7Z_RW6qWkKA": "Interest payment distributed to holders of an interest bearing asset.",
  "_l8aI96Q4EfC7Z_RW6qWkKA": "Also known as change in nominal value or subdivision.|Increase in a corporation's number of outstanding equities without any change in the shareholder's equity or the aggregate market value at the time of the split. Equity price and nominal value are reduced accordingly.",
  "_l8aI9aQ4EfC7Z_RW6qWkKA": "Distribution of subsidiary stock to the shareholders.",
  "_l8aI_aQ4EfC7Z_RW6qWkKA": "Exchange of outstanding securities, initiated by the issuer which may include options, as the result of two or more companies combining assets, that is, an external, third party company. Cash payments may accompany share exchange.",
  "_lHk3YYSKEe-AUMVyVXihZg": "Securities holder has the right to disagree with a mandatory event. This right is not inherent in all offers and therefore must be noted in announcements only when applicable.",
